{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","往赴极乐"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","極楽天国"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对目标位置附近的全部敌人造成多次伤害并魅惑敌人。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","目標位置の近くにいる敵全体にダメージを複数回与え、魅了を付与"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","梅希拉在目标地点生成吻痕，对半径2格范围内的所有敌人冲击6次造成50% + 5% ATK伤害，短暂停顿后，对范围内的敌人强力冲击造成170% + 25% ATK伤害。\n受到强力冲击影响的敌人会被魅惑持续3秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","目標位置にキスマークをつけ、半径2マス以内の敵全体に衝撃を6回与え、1回につき、50% + 5% ATKのダメージを与える。少しだけ時間を置いてから、範囲内の敵に強力な衝撃を与え、170% + 25% ATKのダメージを与える\n強力な衝撃を受けた敵は3秒間、魅了状態になる"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":35,"end":40,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":70,"end":76,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":43,"end":48,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":94,"end":100,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":66,"end":80,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":97,"end":99,"tooltip_key":"keyword:enchanted"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":40,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":90,"end":104,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":129,"end":131,"tooltip_key":"keyword:enchanted"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","强力冲击造成的伤害提升至190% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","強力な衝撃のダメージが190% + 25% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat: