急速。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/jp","前方扇状範囲内の敵と味方にHP流失効果を複数回与え、味方にヒットした場合、さらにその味方の速度UP"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","梅希拉不分敌我地挥动鞭子鞭笞前方半径3格扇形区域内的角色5次，每次鞭笞使其流失20% + 3% ATK的生命。若命中友军，则额外提高其急速25点，持续8秒。该技能对友军造成的生命流失效果降低90%，并且选择能命中最多敌人的方向释放。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","前方の半径3マスの扇状範囲内の敵と味方を鞭で5回攻撃し、1回の鞭攻撃につき、対象のHPが20% + 3% ATK流失。鞭が味方にヒットした場合、さらに8秒間、その味方の速度+25。このスキルで味方に与えるHP流失効果-90%。また、このスキルはヒットできる敵の数が最も多い方向へ発動する"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":42,"end":47,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":47,"end":52,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":39,"end":51,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":44,"end":56,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每次鞭笞造成的生命流失提升至24% + 3% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","鞭攻撃1回ごとのHP流失量が24% + 3% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每次鞭笞造成的生命流失提升至28% + 3% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","鞭攻撃1回ごとのHP流失量が28% + 3% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每次鞭笞造成的生命流失提升至32% + 3% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","鞭攻撃1回ごとのHP流失量が32% + 3% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","魅影狂潮"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/jp","魅了の波"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","吸引全场敌人到目标位置附近。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/jp","フィールド上の敵全体を目標位置の近くへ誘導"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","在距离所有敌人最近位置生成梅希拉的幻象诱惑全场敌人，使他们陷入“痴迷”状态并狂热地奔向幻象，持续2.2 + 0.1秒。战斗开始时会立刻在梅希拉对称的位置生成一次幻象。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","敵全体に最も近い位置に自身の幻影を1つ生成。2.2 + 0.1秒間、敵全体は「虜」状態になり、幻影に向かって移動。戦闘開始時、直ちに自身の対称位置に幻影を1つ生成"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":51,"end":57,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":25,"end":31,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":71,"end":73,"tooltip_key":"keyword:symmetric"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":69,"end":71,"tooltip_key":"keyword:symmetric"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“痴迷”状态的持续时间提升至2.3 + 0.1秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","「虜」状態の持続時間が2.3 + 0.1秒にUP"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“痴迷”状态的持续时间提升至2.4 + 0.1秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","「虜」状態の持続時間が2.4 + 0.1秒にUP"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“痴迷”状态的持续时间提升至2.5 + 0.1秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","「虜」状態の持続時間が2.5 + 0.1秒にUP"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/jp","天賦の才"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗中生命汲取提升，恢复一定生命值后可提高攻击力。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/jp","ライフスティールUP。自身のHPが一定量回復するたびに、攻撃力UP"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","生命汲取提高8点，当自身受到任意来源的生命恢复值达到40%初始最大生命值时，提高6%攻击力，最多可提高18%。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","ライフスティール+8。自身が受けたHP回復量が初期HP上限の40%に達するたびに、攻撃力+6%、最大で+18%まで"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","生命汲取提高10点，当自身受到任意来源的生命恢复值达到40%初始最大生命值时，提高8%攻击力，最多可提高24%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","ライフスティール+10。自身が受けたHP回復量が初期HP上限の40%に達するたびに、攻撃力+8%、最大で+24%まで"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","生命汲取提高12点，当自身受到任意来源的生命恢复值达到40%初始最大生命值时，提高10%攻击力，最多可提高30%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","ライフスティール+12。自身が受けたHP回復量が初期HP上限の40%に達するたびに、攻撃力+10%、最大で+30%まで"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","奉献之爱"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/jp","献身的な愛"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤使魔在身边持续攻击敌人，在危险时献祭使魔使自身暂时无法被选中并恢复生命。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/jp","自身の周囲に敵を持続的に攻撃する使い魔を召喚。自身のHPが低くなる時、使い魔を供物にして、自身のHPを回復、短時間の間、自身は選択不可状態になる"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，梅希拉召唤3只使魔环绕自身，使魔每1.5秒会攻击敌人造成40% ATK伤害。若梅希拉受到任意伤害后生命值即将低于20%，则献祭一个使魔来抵消本次伤害，并使自身在后续2.5秒内无法被选中、且立刻恢复20%最大生命值。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始時、自身の周囲に使い魔を3体召喚。各使い魔は1.5秒ごとに敵を攻撃し、40% ATKのダメージを与える。自身がダメージを受け、HPが20%より低くなる時、使い魔1体を供物にして被ダメージを無効化し、自身のHPをHP上限×20%分回復。その後、自身は2.5秒間、選択不可状態になる"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":39,"end":46,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","使魔攻击造成的伤害提升至50% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","使い魔の攻撃のダメージが50% ATKにUP"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":12,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","使魔攻击造成的伤害提升至60% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","使い魔の攻撃のダメージが60% ATKにUP"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":12,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","梅希拉储存溢出的生命恢复量，每存储相当于50%初始最大生命值的恢复量，便额外召唤一只使魔，每场战斗最多额外召唤3只使魔。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","上限超過分のHP回復量をストックし、ストックしたHP回復量が初期HP上限の50%に達するたびに、追加の使い魔を1体召喚。1度の戦闘につき、3体まで追加召喚可能"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/jp","覚醒の力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","处于自身的魅惑和痴迷效果的敌人受到的伤害增加。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/jp","自身のスキルにより、魅了状態や虜状態になっている敵の被ダメージUP"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","受到技能“往赴极乐”的魅惑效果或技能“魅影狂潮”的痴迷效果影响的敌人，受到的伤害提高15%，该效果不可叠加。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","スキル「極楽天国」による魅了状態やスキル「魅了の波」による虜状態になっている敵は、被ダメージ+15%。被ダメージ上昇効果は重複不可"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"keyword:enchanted"}]],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":12,"end":14,"tooltip_key":"keyword:enchanted"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","屈服之鞭"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/jp","屈服の鞭"]]}